$bog_vmap_part $mol_page
	title \Базовые детали vmap
	- The showcase of the pack: the two parts wired together, and the common
	- components of mol beside them, so that a palette fed by this pack has the
	- basics and not the two parts alone.
	calc_result = Calc result
	body /
		<= Calc $bog_vmap_part_calc
		<= Map $bog_vmap_part_map
			zoom <= calc_result
		<= Kit $mol_list
			rows /
				<= Button_major $mol_button_major
					title \Кнопка
				<= Button_minor $mol_button_minor
					title \Кнопка
				<= String $mol_string
					hint \Строка
				<= Textarea $mol_textarea
					hint \Текст
				<= Number $mol_number
				<= Check $mol_check_box
					title \Флажок
				<= Switch $mol_switch
					options *
						one \Раз
						two \Два
				<= Select $mol_select
					options /
						\Раз
						\Два
				<= Link $mol_link
					title \Ссылка
					uri \https://mol.hyoo.ru
				<= Image $mol_image
					uri \https://mol.hyoo.ru/mol/logo/logo.svg
				<= Text $mol_text
					text \**Разметка**
				<= Paragraph $mol_paragraph
					title \Абзац
				<= Labeler $mol_labeler
					title \Подпись
					content / \Значение
				<= Row $mol_row
				<= Card $mol_card
				<= Form $mol_form
				<= Field $mol_form_field
					name \Поле
